A||||4||Rodney||Replacement GT exhaust tips? Any interest?||||3||
Z||000000||Rodney||11-20-2001||05:09 PM||||In my ongoing quest to make my new exhaust systems I had an idea for exhaust tips for the stock system. Is there any interest in replacement tips? These would be dual resonated 304 highly polished stainless steel tips. They are 3" round. The OEM factory tips on the GT's are about 3" on the large outside ends. I would have the 90 degree bend mandrel bent and weld the tips to them so they install like OEM. These are the tips I'll be using in my new systems. In my systems I'll have a expanded pipe and a clamp on each tip so you can adjust the in and out and the angle before it goes to the 90 degree bend. If I make these I would probably make them one piece like factory originals. The 90 degree pipes would be 409 stainless like OEM. They would install like OEM. I would expect the price to be about $85? each. ||||reg||3
